ategory tree once, and its persistence note names the folder results are recorded in. |`` Verify: `rg -c \"Verifies manual testing playbook routing fixtures\" $TR` prints nothing and `rg -c \"Checks the playbook inventory\" $TR` prints 1.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"^- \\\\[ \\\\] T024 \",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/017-review-pass-two-remediation/tasks.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794589555096,"end":1794589555210}}}}
